      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '

    Laura Hudson, RN

    As a Registered Nurse (RN) with over 20 years
    of experience in the healthcare industry, I possess a comprehensive understanding
    of healthcare services, patient care, education, anatomy, and the holistic aspects
    of healing and wellness. I hold a Bachelor of Business Administration from Georgia
    State University, a Bachelor of Science in Nursing from Texas A&M University,
    and a Master of Business Administration with a concentration in Health Services
    Administration from Alaska Pacific University. Currently, I am enhancing my technical
    skills in 3D animation, virtual/augmented/mixed reality, 3D modeling/sculpting,
    as well as processing, segmentation, registration, and analysis of medical and
    biomedical 3D images. My aim is to create beautiful and engaging medical training
    and education resources of the highest caliber.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
